{"type":"message","id":"1de4e559","parentId":"3df60187","timestamp":"2026-04-03T14:10:49.674Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a heartbeat poll. I need to read the HEARTBEAT.md file and follow its instructions. The current time is Friday, April 3rd, 2026 at 10:10 PM (Asia/Shanghai).\n\nLet me read the HEARTBEAT.md file first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vynau0kithx6_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":21929,"output":158,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775225442846}}
{"type":"message","id":"477820f3","parentId":"1de4e559","timestamp":"2026-04-03T14:10:49.684Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vynau0kithx6_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔔 触发条件\n\n- 正常扫描: 每4小时\n- 重大事件: 新闻关键词触发\n- 止损触发: 模拟持仓触发止损\n\n---\n\n## 📤 输出\n\n- 信号文件: `signals/YYYY-MM-DD.json`\n- 报告文件: `reports/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 持仓更新: `paper-trading/portfolio.json`\n\n---\n\n*心跳配置版本: 1.0*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775225449683}}
{"type":"message","id":"ec94bcf2","parentId":"477820f3","timestamp":"2026-04-03T14:10:57.301Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to follow the heartbeat tasks. The current time is 22:10 (10:10 PM) Shanghai time, which corresponds to the **夜盘扫描** (Night Scan) slot - 收盘数据,每日报告.\n\nThis is the 22:00 slot for:\n- 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- 更新 performance.json\n\nLet me check what exists in the workspace:\n1. Check if signals directory and today's file exist\n2. Check if paper-trading portfolio exists\n3. Check if reports directory exists\n4. Generate the daily report\n\nLet me first check the directory structure.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mdc93v37ql20_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /workspace/projects/workspace/signals/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"signals dir not found\"; ls -la /workspace/projects/workspace/paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"paper-trading dir not found\"; ls -la /workspace/projects/workspace/reports/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"reports dir not found\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":444,"output":356,"cacheRead":21949,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22749,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775225449684}}
